  "passageText": "<div class=\"bg-gray-200 p-4 md:p-8 rounded border-2 border-gray-400 font-sans shadow-md relative text-gray-900\">\n  <!-- Header -->\n  <div class=\"text-center mb-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold tracking-widest mb-1 text-gray-800\">テニス教室 生徒募集！</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-medium text-gray-700\">一緒にテニスをしませんか？</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Illustration (Tennis Emoji as placeholder) -->\n  <div class=\"absolute top-12 right-6 md:right-12 text-6xl md:text-8xl opacity-80\" style=\"transform: rotate(15deg);\">\n    🎾\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Information Details -->\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 mb-8 text-sm md:text-base pr-20 md:pr-40 relative z-10 leading-relaxed\">\n    <div><span class=\"font-bold w-20 md:w-28 inline-block\"><ruby>対象<rt>たいしょう</rt></ruby></span><span>20<ruby>歳<rt>さい</rt></ruby>以上。A市<ruby>在住<rt>ざいじゅう</rt></ruby>・<ruby>在勤<rt>ざいきん</rt></ruby><span class=\"text-xs\">（注1）</span>・<ruby>在学<rt>ざいがく</rt></ruby><span class=\"text-xs\">（注2）</span></span></div>\n    <div><span class=\"font-bold w-20 md:w-28 inline-block\"><ruby>期間<rt>きかん</rt></ruby></span><span>4月〜7月（各コース全15回）</span></div>\n    <div><span class=\"font-bold w-20 md:w-28 inline-block\"><ruby>場所<rt>ばしょ</rt></ruby></span><span>さくらテニスコート</span></div>\n    <div><span class=\"font-bold w-20 md:w-28 inline-block\"><ruby>定員<rt>ていいん</rt></ruby></span><span>各クラス14人まで（定員になったらしめきり）</span></div>\n    <div><span class=\"font-bold w-20 md:w-28 inline-block\"><ruby>費用<rt>ひよう</rt></ruby></span><span>3,000円</span></div>\n    <div class=\"flex\">\n      <span class=\"font-bold w-20 md:w-28 flex-shrink-0\"><ruby>申<rt>もう</rt></ruby>し<ruby>込<rt>こ</rt></ruby>み<ruby>方法<rt>ほうほう</rt></ruby></span>\n      <span><ruby>往復<rt>おうふく</rt></ruby>はがき（1人1枚）に希望するクラス名、曜日、時間、住所、名前、電話番号を書いて、2月15日(水)までに下記までお送りください。結果は返信はがきで、3月中旬頃までに発送します。</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Contact Info -->\n  <div class=\"mb-8 space-y-1 text-sm md:text-base relative z-10\">\n    <p><span class=\"font-bold w-28 inline-block\">はがきの<ruby>宛<rt>あ</rt></ruby>て<ruby>先<rt>さき</rt></ruby></span>〒101-2222 A市山田町2-2-2 さくらテニスクラブ</p>\n    <p><span class=\"font-bold w-28 inline-block flex items-center gap-1\"><ruby>問<rt>と</rt></ruby>い<ruby>合<rt>あ</rt></ruby>わせ<ruby>先<rt>さき</rt></ruby></span>☎ 033-111-2222</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Table Schedule -->\n  <div class=\"overflow-x-auto relative z-10\">\n    <table class=\"w-full border-collapse border border-gray-400 text-center text-sm md:text-base bg-gray-100\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-gray-300\">\n          <th class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"></th>\n          <th class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\">時間</th>\n          <th class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\">月</th>\n          <th class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\">火</th>\n          <th class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\">水</th>\n          <th class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\">木</th>\n          <th class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\">金</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 bg-gray-200\">1</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 bg-gray-200\">9:00-10:20</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>初級<rt>しょきゅう</rt></ruby> a</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>中上級<rt>ちゅうじょうきゅう</rt></ruby></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>初級<rt>しょきゅう</rt></ruby> e</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>初級<rt>しょきゅう</rt></ruby> f</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 bg-gray-200\">2</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 bg-gray-200\">10:40-12:00</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>上級<rt>じょうきゅう</rt></ruby></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>初中級<rt>しょちゅうきゅう</rt></ruby></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>上級<rt>じょうきゅう</rt></ruby></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 bg-gray-200\">3</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 bg-gray-200\">15:00-16:20</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>中上級<rt>ちゅうじょうきゅう</rt></ruby></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>初中級<rt>しょちゅうきゅう</rt></ruby></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 bg-gray-200\">4</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2 bg-gray-200\">17:00-18:20</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>中級<rt>ちゅうきゅう</rt></ruby> b</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>中級<rt>ちゅうきゅう</rt></ruby> c</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>初級<rt>しょきゅう</rt></ruby> d</td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>上級<rt>じょうきゅう</rt></ruby></td>\n          <td class=\"border border-gray-400 p-2\"><ruby>中上級<rt>ちゅうじょうきゅう</rt></ruby> g</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>",
